<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-03T01:42:30.386Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:42:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence in northern Ethiopia continues to push the health system toward collapse as WHO warns it is near failure, while renewed drone strikes from Ethiopia target Sudan and an Amhara displacement camp and civilians gathering grain in Tigray. Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed has sent senior ministers to military training in Hurso and Ethiopia is accused of using Assosa Airport as a launch base for RSF drones and supplying arms to the RSF. An RPG fired near a school in Moyale killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers, prompting the Orthodox Church to demand action. The conflict has displaced 1.7 million Ethiopians and affected an additional 173,000 people, according to UNHCR, and there were 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE50YUdFOTZZQ2ROVnp1eHFpYUt4QkhfbV9JRWNyNW5KaHFWWTc1UnNOekdsOUZ3X0VURmxkdzYxYktyU29lbDdwNEdOZnZEWU93VmZxajg0bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOTkxzZzJhZkx3NVpUQWZhN0xQQ3ZSWGMwZGFsaXhpZzJMVXFNR0QwZVlsYkphSWhGdHV4bXpXSkI3VkZ5cWJuMF9uVHZfWlZpM1Axc2NySUZiTy1FYXN6THIxTzJCQU92c3UwZkpDM0NlZ1pEdnp5X19VUnF4REV5M1NDTWVNLXg5SmUyUzNYUzkzMFRYd1p3Qw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPc09MamhGU2gwSkNheHVDaHUtNGNUOUw3QXVWQmdJdFBJbzRKT1k0VjlaeDhSeUZyUGZIMGZ4VHJOcGY1NFFaTjItdFkxYmhzM1ZUZGFNWTE3VDVZNVdEdllnam1BS0RJVElJNWdkZUgzWFJLOFVudXpzLVhQdGVxRVhlcnZDVlZNSFVCcXJqVGFzc3ByNUttbU1NSnNFS0JqSElfRmpORV9KQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;International Christian Concern&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBwZXozdXFwZTVHc0lPVXF2OWct